CORE
undriven_bits_frozen1.sv
--bound 4
^\[main\.p_part\] always !main\.started \|\| main\.v\[3:0\] == main\.v_prev: REFUTED$
^\[main\.p_whole\] always !main\.started \|\| main\.w == main\.w_prev: REFUTED$
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
^warning: ignoring
--
Bits of a net that have no driver (v[3:0], where only v[7:4] is assigned)
are free in every timeframe, as a net with no driver at all (w) is.
